   $q$What is the main function of sentence 2 in the report?$q$, $q$[{"text":"It gives evidence that stepwells raised the level of groundwater.","is_correct":false,"misconception_token":"misreads-purpose"},{"text":"It states an opinion about the beauty of stepwells.","is_correct":false,"misconception_token":"fact-read-as-opinion"},{"text":"It defines the key term by describing what a stepwell is.","is_correct":true},{"text":"It explains why stepwells were abandoned in the late 1800s.","is_correct":false,"misconception_token":"confuses-paragraph-focus"}]$q$::jsonb, $q$It defines the key term by describing what a stepwell is.$q$, $q$Sentence 2 tells readers what a stepwell is, which they need before the rest of the report describes its design and history. It contains no measurements, so it is not evidence about groundwater.$q$, 'draft', 'd0501be2-285f-5383-a0c9-d1b5a53f9181')
