   $q$The report has no concluding statement. Which sentence, added at the end, would best conclude it?$q$, $q$[{"text":"The Kestrel Dawn spent eleven days repairing a single cable break in 2022.","is_correct":false,"misconception_token":"restates-detail"},{"text":"Though rarely seen, this network of cables, repeaters and repair ships quietly carries most of the world's online communication.","is_correct":true},{"text":"Submarine cables are honestly the coolest technology on the whole planet.","is_correct":false,"misconception_token":"informal-overstatement"},{"text":"Satellites are also used to send television signals around the world.","is_correct":false,"misconception_token":"introduces-new-topic"}]$q$::jsonb, $q$Though rarely seen, this network of cables, repeaters and repair ships quietly carries most of the world's online communication.$q$, $q$The correct sentence sums up the cables, repeaters and repairs described in the report and states why they matter. The sentence about the Kestrel Dawn only repeats sentence 12.$q$, 'draft', 'cee10173-2559-5bbe-bef4-df294d6d2c8c')
