  ('75ac94a3-24ab-53ab-8580-f1a9536ca547', null, (select id from public.skills where slug = 'write-g12-paragraph-transitions'), null, 'medium',
   $q$The writer wants to replace sentence 9 with a topic sentence that previews the paragraph more precisely. Which choice best does this?$q$, $q$[{"text":"New inventions have always changed the way people live and work in surprising ways.","is_correct":false,"misconception_token":"too-broad"},{"text":"The container did more than speed up loading; it changed where goods were made and how they reached buyers.","is_correct":true},{"text":"Cranes at container ports grew steadily taller as ships became wider and carried more cargo.","is_correct":false,"misconception_token":"too-narrow"},{"text":"Dockworkers in many ports had to learn new skills once the old loading methods disappeared.","is_correct":false,"misconception_token":"off-topic"}]$q$::jsonb, $q$The container did more than speed up loading; it changed where goods were made and how they reached buyers.$q$, $q$The paragraph covers faster loading, lower costs, distant factories, and global supply chains, and the correct choice previews both the speed and the wider economic change. The sentence about inventions in general is too broad, since it says nothing about containers or trade.$q$, 'draft', '33011e71-74ef-59c1-b7fc-fe66df57b856')
