   $q$What does sentence 7 add to the writer's argument?$q$, $q$[{"text":"It raises an objection that the writer answers later in the draft.","is_correct":false,"misconception_token":"misidentifies-counterclaim"},{"text":"It gives a new statistic about the number of shoppers on weeknights.","is_correct":false,"misconception_token":"misreads-purpose"},{"text":"It explains why weeknight hours show a lasting change rather than a boost limited to market nights.","is_correct":true},{"text":"It shows that stall owners earned more money than the shop owners did.","is_correct":false,"misconception_token":"unsupported-inference"}]$q$::jsonb, $q$It explains why weeknight hours show a lasting change rather than a boost limited to market nights.$q$, $q$Sentence 7 spells out the reasoning behind sentence 6: shops staying open on nights without a market shows that residents now visit the street at night in general. It contains no statistic; it explains why the evidence in sentence 5 matters.$q$, 'draft', 'c1b0f55b-26fe-5cb1-a767-e8fc11297af6')
