  ('bf93ea1e-0318-51c7-9e6b-e777cdba76aa', null, (select id from public.skills where slug = 'write-g12-writing-with-evidence'), null, 'hard',
   $q$Which statement best describes how sentence 11 strengthens the draft?$q$, $q$[{"text":"It proves that the apartment building had no effect at all on business along Mercer Street.","is_correct":false,"misconception_token":"overstates-evidence"},{"text":"It replaces Bakr's claim with a new claim about when the apartment building was finished.","is_correct":false,"misconception_token":"misreads-purpose"},{"text":"It shows that the writer disagrees with Bakr's decision to mention the apartment building.","is_correct":false,"misconception_token":"unsupported-inference"},{"text":"It answers the alternative cause in sentence 10 with timing evidence that points back to the market.","is_correct":true}]$q$::jsonb, $q$It answers the alternative cause in sentence 10 with timing evidence that points back to the market.$q$, $q$Because the longer hours began a year before the apartments opened, the market is the more likely starting point, which answers the objection. The writer says this "suggests" the market started the change; it does not prove the apartments had no effect at all.$q$, 'draft', 'c1b0f55b-26fe-5cb1-a767-e8fc11297af6')
