   $q$Which revision corrects this sentence: "When only six years old, Leon's grandmother taught him to bake bread."?$q$, $q$[{"text":"When only six years old, Leon's grandmother taught Leon to bake bread.","is_correct":false,"misconception_token":"possessive-as-subject"},{"text":"When Leon was only six years old, his grandmother taught him to bake bread.","is_correct":true},{"text":"Leon's grandmother, when only six years old, taught him to bake bread.","is_correct":false,"misconception_token":"moves-dangler-to-middle"},{"text":"When only six years old, bread was taught to Leon by his grandmother.","is_correct":false,"misconception_token":"passive-voice-fix"}]$q$::jsonb, $q$When Leon was only six years old, his grandmother taught him to bake bread.$q$, $q$The short clause "When only six years old" leaves out its subject, so it attaches to "grandmother" and makes her six. Adding "Leon was" names who was six and removes the confusion.$q$, 'draft', null)
